  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in an iron teppan at 180°C.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the confited tomato, salt, and black pepper. Stir well.",
    "Create 4 wells in the mixture and break an egg into each well. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the crumbled Turkish cheese and stir until melted.",
    "Add the almond extract and stir well.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Let the dish rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
